[Trigger]
Name	dusk
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	The mire is awake, master. Watcher Mora Fenwick has eight towers in the marsh and she sleeps in the last of them, behind sealed ground.
Action	objective	1	Kill Watcher Mora Fenwick in her tower, in the north-east.
Action	objective	1	You have only workers: dig, claim and build before you march.
Action	objective	1	Take the towers on the way, one by one.
Action	portal	1	off
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstCoin
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	400
Action	message	1	The first coin of the mire. Rooms and traps are yours to build.
Action	gold	1	600
Action	spawn	1	21	111	1	Orc:2	Goblin:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollowHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Hollow	40
Action	message	1	The hollow is held and your portal draws creatures again. A causeway leads east across the black water to the first tower.
